# placement — шаги записи (что показывается — placement.md)
# Этап 1 — умолчания; каждый следующий начинается заходом в настройки.
title Placement modes | Add a bullet and tidy typed tags into their Block
open Placement.md
caret call the bank
# Его замечание 2026-10-05: фокус не на каретке, а на Prefix.
mark prefix
stage Default placement
say Default: Status next → no bullet is added
cmd status-next
expect #todo || call the bank / - pay the rent #high
caret - pay the rent #high
say Default: a typed tag stays in the text
cmd status-next
expect #todo || call the bank / - #todo || pay the rent #high

stage Strict: add a bullet
say Strict: add a bullet → on
settings Tags & PKM
set Strict: add a bullet = on
caret call the bank
say Status next → the line gets a bullet
cmd status-next
expect - #todo || call the bank / - pay the rent #high

stage Typed tags to their Block
say Keep typed tags in text → off
settings Tags & PKM
set Keep typed tags in text = off
caret - pay the rent #high
say Status next → #high moves to its Block
cmd status-next
expect call the bank / - #todo #high || pay the rent
